# Project specific
clips
# Any database file, not just detections.db: the copies made while debugging hold
# real detections too, and the release workflow refuses to publish one.
*.db
# Claude Code's project files, which record local paths.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
# Downloaded region packs, and the data directory if anyone points it inside the
# checkout. Both hold runtime state, never source.
region-packs
data
# The one-time setup token. A station keeps it in the data directory, but a checkout
# has no separate one, so writing it to reopen the wizard leaves it in the repository
# root.
setup-token
# The CPython apply.sh has uv download when a person deploys from a checkout. It
# goes here rather than under that person's home, which the service user running
# the units cannot read into.
.python
# Large eBird occurrence rasters, re-downloadable with tools/ebird_downloader.py
backyardchirps/species_data/assets/ebird_occurrence
# Written by update_species_data: the refreshed taxonomy and the station's own species
# list, plus the BirdNET 3 and GeoModel downloads under generated/birdnet3/.
backyardchirps/species_data/generated

